<title>PORTUGAL: PORTUGUESE BONDS DRIFT HIGHER, LACK VOLUME.</title>
<headline>PORTUGUESE BONDS DRIFT HIGHER, LACK VOLUME.</headline>
<text>
<p>1645 GMT - Bonds drifted higher but surprised traders by not keeping pace with the Bunds. Nevertheless, the spread at the longer end was not seen widening beyond 70 basis points.</p>
<p>*Sept 97 futures up 17 at 110.13 vs Friday close</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash (OTC) 101.65 vs 101.40. Yld 6.38 vs 6.40</p>
<p>*Spread vs 10-yr cash Bund 70 bps vs 69</p>
